C4Context
  accTitle: System context
  accDescr: Coordinators, hospital staff and families use Navexa Health. Navexa sends only the hospital location to OpenStreetMap and Google Maps. It sends what the family asks the assistant, and what staff type, say or photograph for a draft, to Claude and Sarvam. Families can call emergency number 108.
